## SQ-VN-01 | a single planted lattice takes bone meal at stages 1 and 2; an empty lattice takes none; stage 3 click harvests
@group A
@commands stone at 640 -60 520 and 641 -60 520, 642 -60 520; place `vinery:grapevine_lattice` on their south faces (y -59, glass under nothing: the lattice at y -59 has air below); plant jungle white seeds in the first two; `/cdevtest use` with `minecraft:bone_meal*4` on the stage 1 lattice, the empty one, and a stage 3 one
@pass planted stage 1: bone meal used and the lattice at stage 2 or more; empty lattice: bone meal kept (`main=minecraft:bone_meal*4`); stage 3: the click harvests (2 jungle grapes on the ground, back to stage 1, bone meal kept)
@fails `LegacyLatticeStemBlock.isValidBonemealTarget` (age > 0 and not mature, no lattice-below check); the grapevine stem's own trunk rule is separate (2.4)
@reviewed 2026-11-20
> forceload add 636 516 648 524
> time set noon
> fill 640 -60 520 642 -59 520 minecraft:stone
> cdevtest place 640 -59 521 vinery:grapevine_lattice[facing=south] flags=18
> cdevtest place 641 -59 521 vinery:grapevine_lattice[facing=south] flags=18
> cdevtest place 642 -59 521 vinery:grapevine_lattice[facing=south] flags=18
> cdevtest use 640 -59 521 held=vinery:jungle_grape_seeds_white hand=main
> cdevtest use 642 -59 521 held=vinery:jungle_grape_seeds_white hand=main
> cdevtest use 642 -59 521 held=minecraft:bone_meal hand=main
> cdevtest use 642 -59 521 held=minecraft:bone_meal hand=main
> cdevtest state 640 -59 521
> cdevtest state 642 -59 521
expect verb=state pos=640,-59,521 state="vinery:grapevine_lattice\[age=1,
expect verb=state pos=642,-59,521 state="vinery:grapevine_lattice\[age=3,
> cdevtest items 642 -59 521 3
> cdevtest use 640 -59 521 held=minecraft:bone_meal*4 hand=main
> cdevtest use 641 -59 521 held=minecraft:bone_meal*4 hand=main
> cdevtest use 642 -59 521 held=minecraft:bone_meal*4 hand=main
> cdevtest items 642 -59 521 3
expect verb=use main=minecraft:bone_meal\*3 off=\S+ state="vinery:grapevine_lattice\[age=[2-4],
expect verb=use main=minecraft:bone_meal\*4 off=\S+ state="vinery:grapevine_lattice\[age=0,
expect verb=use main=minecraft:bone_meal\*4 off=\S+ state="vinery:grapevine_lattice\[age=1,
expect verb=items items=\S*vinery:jungle_grapes_white:2\b
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look if the 642 lattice is not at age 3 after the two single bone meals (growth per use differs), the harvest lines do not apply: rerun with a third single bone meal; the state lines give the grape property name for later rows
